{"content":"\n<p>நபித்தோழர் உக்காஸா (ரழி)அவர்களின் அடக்கத்தலம்<br />பரங்கிப்பேட்டை…</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img width=\"720\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/121706742_181002520315206_3342813910746035225_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks – Thazahi Mathiyavan</p>\n","quranRefs":[],"hadithRefs":[],"lang":"ta","wordCount":10,"coverSourceUrl":"http://penakkal.local/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/121706742_181002520315206_3342813910746035225_n-1.jpg"}